  <entry>
    <title>Kalman 滤波 - 2. 高斯分布与矩阵理论</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/26/kalman_2/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/26/kalman_2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>本文介绍正定矩阵、二次函数梯度与 Hessian 矩阵的基本性质，并通过 LaTeX展示多行公式和矩阵表达式。</p><span id="more"></span><h1 id="高斯分布的变换">1. 高斯分布的变换</h1><p>若已知<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="double-struck">ℝ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu\in\mathbb{R}^n</annotation></semantics></math>、<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo>≻</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma\succ0</annotation></semantics></math>，先分解<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma=LL^T</annotation></semantics></math>，再生成<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z\sim\mathcal N(0,I_n)</annotation></semantics></math>，最后构造<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>Z</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}X=\mu+LZ.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 即可得到<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\sim\mathcal N(\mu,\Sigma)</annotation></semantics></math>反复独立抽取标准高斯向量<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z^{(1)},\ldots,Z^{(N)}</annotation></semantics></math>，便得到<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>个目标分布样本<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X^{(j)}=\mu+LZ^{(j)}</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h1 id="联合高斯的条件分布还是高斯">2. 联合高斯的条件分布还是高斯</h1><p>设<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\begin{bmatrix}    X_1\\    X_2\end{bmatrix}\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\begin{bmatrix}    \mu_1\\    \mu_2\end{bmatrix},\begin{bmatrix}    \Sigma_{11}&amp;\Sigma_{12}\\    \Sigma_{21}&amp;\Sigma_{22}\end{bmatrix}\right),\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 其中整个协方差矩阵正定，故<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{11}</annotation></semantics></math>也正定且可逆。我们的目标是求已知<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_1=x_1</annotation></semantics></math>时<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_2</annotation></semantics></math>的条件分布。</p><p>上述条件下，<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}X_2\mid X_1=x_1\sim\mathcal N(\mu_{2|1},\Sigma_{2|1}),\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 其中<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\mu_{2|1}&amp;=\mu_2+\Sigma_{21}\Sigma_{11}^{-1}(x_1-\mu_1),\\\Sigma_{2|1}&amp;=\Sigma_{22}-\Sigma_{21}\Sigma_{11}^{-1}\Sigma_{12}.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 设<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K=\Sigma_{21}\Sigma_{11}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math>，构造残差随机向量<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}Y=X_2-\mu_2-K(X_1-\mu_1).\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math>第一步计算均值：<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[Y]=0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>第二步计算<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y</annotation></semantics></math>和<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_1</annotation></semantics></math>的互协方差：<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\operatorname{Cov}(Y,X_1)&amp;=\operatorname{Cov}(X_2,X_1)-K\operatorname{Cov}(X_1,X_1)\\&amp;=\Sigma_{21}-\Sigma_{21}\Sigma_{11}^{-1}\Sigma_{11}\\&amp;=0.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 因为<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(Y,X_1)</annotation></semantics></math>是联合高斯随机向量，所以互协方差为零足以推出二者独立。</p><p>第三步计算<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y</annotation></semantics></math>的协方差：<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\operatorname{Cov}(Y)&amp;=\Sigma_{22}-K\Sigma_{12}-\Sigma_{21}K^T+K\Sigma_{11}K^T\\&amp;=\Sigma_{22}-\Sigma_{21}\Sigma_{11}^{-1}\Sigma_{12}.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 第四步利用<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y</annotation></semantics></math>的定义反解<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}X_2=\mu_2+K(X_1-\mu_1)+Y.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 当<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_1=x_1</annotation></semantics></math>已给定时，前两项变成常量，且<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y</annotation></semantics></math>与<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_1</annotation></semantics></math>独立，所以<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y</annotation></semantics></math>的条件分布没有改变。因此<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_2</annotation></semantics></math>的条件分布仍然是高斯。</p><ul><li><math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{22}-\Sigma_{21}\Sigma_{11}^{-1}\Sigma_{12}</annotation></semantics></math>是联合协方差矩阵关于左上块<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{11}</annotation></semantics></math>的 Schur 补。这说明在联合高斯模型中，条件协方差可由 Schur补精确计算。</li><li>条件均值还可以写成<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">|</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo accent="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathvariant="normal">观测后的估计</mtext></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathvariant="normal">原先均值</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mi>K</mi><mo accent="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathvariant="normal">增益</mtext></munder><munder><munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><mo accent="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathvariant="normal">观测偏差</mtext></munder><mi>.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\underbrace{\mu_{2|1}}_{\text{观测后的估计}}=\underbrace{\mu_2}_{\text{原先均值}}+\underbrace{K}_{\text{增益}}\underbrace{(x_1-\mu_1)}_{\text{观测偏差}}.</annotation></semantics></math>这与卡尔曼滤波中的“先验估计<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>+</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+</annotation></semantics></math>增益<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>×</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math>创新”具有相同的代数结构。</li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>凸优化数学公式测试</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/26/cvx_test/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/26/cvx_test/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>本文介绍正定矩阵、二次函数梯度与 Hessian 矩阵的基本性质，并通过 LaTeX展示多行公式和矩阵表达式。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="行内公式">1. 行内公式</h2><p>对于正定矩阵<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≻</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P \succ 0</annotation></semantics></math>，有<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>⊤</mi></msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x^\top P x &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h2 id="多行公式">2. 多行公式</h2><p><math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>⊤</mi></msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>⊤</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><mi>∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msup><mi>∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}f(x) &amp;= \frac{1}{2}x^\top P x + q^\top x,\\\nabla f(x) &amp;= Px+q,\\\nabla^2 f(x) &amp;= P.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></p><h2 id="矩阵公式">3. 矩阵公式</h2><p><math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P =\begin{bmatrix}p_{11} &amp; p_{12}\\p_{21} &amp; p_{22}\end{bmatrix}.</annotation></semantics></math></p><h2 id="定理">4. 定理</h2><p><strong>定理：</strong> 若<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>⊤</mi></msup><mo>≻</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P=P^\top\succ 0</annotation></semantics></math>，则二次函数</p><p><math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>⊤</mi></msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>⊤</mi></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=\frac{1}{2}x^\top Px+q^\top x</annotation></semantics></math></p><p>存在唯一的全局最优解。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>Kalman 滤波 - 1. 多维高斯分布</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/26/kalman_1/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/26/kalman_1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>本文介绍正定矩阵、二次函数梯度与 Hessian 矩阵的基本性质，并通过 LaTeX展示多行公式和矩阵表达式。</p><span id="more"></span><h1 id="一维高斯分布">1. 一维高斯分布</h1><h2 id="一维概率密度均值与方差">1.1 一维概率密度、均值与方差</h2><p>设<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\sim\mathcal{N}(\mu,\sigma^2)</annotation></semantics></math>，其中<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。它的概率密度函数为<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">exp</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}p_X(x)&amp;=\frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi\sigma^2}}\cdot\exp\left(-\frac{(x-\mu)^2}{2\sigma^2}\right)\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 均值<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu=\mathbb{E}[X]</annotation></semantics></math>决定密度曲线的中心；方差<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma^2=\mathbb{E}\left[(X-\mu)^2\right]</annotation></semantics></math>衡量围绕中心的波动程度。</p><h2 id="标准高斯变量的平移与缩放">1.2 标准高斯变量的平移与缩放</h2><p>令<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z\sim\mathcal N(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，定义$ X = + Z$.</p><p>计算均值：<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>σ</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\mathbb{E}[X]=\mathbb{E}[\mu+\sigma Z]=\mu+\sigma\mathbb{E}[Z]=\mu.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 计算方差：<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Var</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mi>Z</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\operatorname{Var}(X)&amp;=\mathbb{E}[(X-\mu)^2]\\&amp;=\mathbb{E}[(\sigma Z)^2]\\&amp;=\sigma^2\mathbb{E}[Z^2]\\&amp;=\sigma^2.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 因此<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant="script">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\sim\mathcal N(\mu,\sigma^2)</annotation></semantics></math>。简单说，<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>控制缩放，<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math>控制平移。高维高斯只是把标量缩放变为矩阵线性变换。</p><h1 id="多维高斯分布">2. 多维高斯分布</h1><h2 id="从方差到协方差矩阵">2.1 从方差到协方差矩阵</h2><p><strong>定义：</strong> 若<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_i,X_j</annotation></semantics></math>都有有限二阶矩，记<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_i=\mathbb{E}[X_i]</annotation></semantics></math>、<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_j=\mathbb{E}[X_j]</annotation></semantics></math>，则<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\operatorname{Cov}(X_i,X_j)=\mathbb{E}[(X_i-\mu_i)(X_j-\mu_j)].\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></p><h2 id="协方差矩阵的逐元素推导">2.2 协方差矩阵的逐元素推导</h2>对于<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X=(X_1,X_2)^T</annotation></semantics></math>，先构造去均值向量[ X-=<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{bmatrix}X_1-\mu_1\\X_2-\mu_2\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math><p>. ] 它与自身转置的外积为<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}(X-\mu)(X-\mu)^T=\begin{bmatrix}(X_1-\mu_1)^2&amp;(X_1-\mu_1)(X_2-\mu_2)\\(X_2-\mu_2)(X_1-\mu_1)&amp;(X_2-\mu_2)^2\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 对每个元素取期望，得到<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right"><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="center" style="text-align: center"><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\Sigma=\mathbb{E}[(X-\mu)(X-\mu)^T]=\begin{bmatrix}\sigma_1^2&amp;\sigma_{12}\\\sigma_{12}&amp;\sigma_2^2\end{bmatrix},\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 其中<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{12}=\operatorname{Cov}(X_1,X_2)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>推广到<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>维，设 <spanclass="math inline">$X\in\R^n$</span>，<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu=\mathbb{E}[X]</annotation></semantics></math>，定义<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="double-struck">ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\Sigma&amp;=\operatorname{Cov}(X)\\&amp;=\mathbb{E}[(X-\mu)(X-\mu)^T]\in\mathbb{R}^{n\times n},\\\Sigma_{ij}&amp;=\operatorname{Cov}(X_i,X_j).\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math>主对角线上是各个分量的方差，非对角线上是成对的协方差。这说明一维方差就是<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math>时的协方差矩阵。</p><h2 id="协方差矩阵对称半正定">2.3 协方差矩阵对称半正定</h2><p><strong>定理：</strong> 若 <spanclass="math inline">$X\in\R^n$</span> 有有限二阶矩，则<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Cov</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma=\operatorname{Cov}(X)</annotation></semantics></math>满足 -<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma^T=\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>即<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo>≽</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma\succeq0</annotation></semantics></math>- 对任意确定向量 <spanclass="math inline">$a\in\R^n$</span>，<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Var</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{Var}(a^TX)=a^T\Sigma a</annotation></semantics></math>.</p><p>首先由转置与期望的线性性质，<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">(</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">(</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">)</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">[</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}\Sigma^T&amp;=\left(\mathbb{E}[(X-\mu)(X-\mu)^T]\right)^T\\&amp;=\mathbb{E}\left[\left((X-\mu)(X-\mu)^T\right)^T\right]\\&amp;=\mathbb{E}[(X-\mu)(X-\mu)^T]=\Sigma.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 其次，任取 <spanclass="math inline">$a\in\R^n$</span>，得到<math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="true" form="prefix">[</mo><mo minsize="120%" maxsize="120%" stretchy="true" form="prefix">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><msup><mo minsize="120%" maxsize="120%" stretchy="true" form="postfix">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="true" form="postfix">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign="right" style="text-align: right; padding-right: 0"></mtd><mtd columnalign="left" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 0"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Var</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}a^T\Sigma a&amp;=\mathbb{E}\left[a^T(X-\mu)(X-\mu)^Ta\right]\\&amp;=\mathbb{E}\left[\big(a^T(X-\mu)\big)^2\right]\\&amp;=\operatorname{Var}(a^TX)\geq0.\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math> 因此<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>对称半正定，且同时<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Var</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false" form="prefix">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false" form="postfix">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{Var}(a^TX)=a^T\Sigma a</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
